    </p><a href="/">← Home</a><pagefind-searchbox></pagefind-searchbox><script type="module" src="/pagefind/pagefind-component-ui.js"></script><script type="text/javascript" src="/static/pagefind.js"></script><h1 class="register-section" data-pagefind-body="1" data-pagefind-weight="10" data-pagefind-sort="title">DBGVCR32_EL2</h1><p class="insn_subtitle" data-pagefind-body="1">Debug Vector Catch Register</p><div data-pagefind-body="1">
        <p>Allows access to the AArch32 register <a href="AArch32-dbgvcr.html">DBGVCR</a> from AArch64 state only. Its value has no effect on execution in AArch64 state.</p>
      </div><h3>Configuration</h3><p>AArch64 System register DBGVCR32_EL2 bits [31:0] are architecturally mapped to AArch32 System register <a href="AArch32-dbgvcr.html">DBGVCR[31:0]</a>.</p><p>This register is present only when FEAT_AA32EL1 is implemented and FEAT_AA64 is implemented. Otherwise, direct accesses to DBGVCR32_EL2 are <span class="arm-defined-word">UNDEFINED</span>.</p>
        <p>If EL2 is not implemented but EL3 is implemented, and EL1 is capable of using AArch32, then this register is not <span class="arm-defined-word">RES0</span>.</p>
      <h3>Attributes</h3>
        <p>DBGVCR32_EL2 is a 64-bit register.</p>
